{"product_id":"times-of-contempt","title":"Times Of Contempt","description":"\u003cp\u003eCiri is the child of prophesy, foretold to have the power to change the world, for good or for evil. And she's finally on her way to the magical college on Thanedd Island to learn how to master her powers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAccompanied by the powerful anchantress Yennefer, the journey should be a simple one, but they are being followed and shortly afterward Ciri is mistaken for a student and arrested. Seperated from Yennefer and thrown on her own resources, Ciri turns to Geraly, a powerful Witcher, for aid ... and takes the first steps along a path which will lead to revolution ...\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andrzej Sapkowski\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780575090941\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Trade Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 331\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595542532249,"sku":"10RF9780575090941","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/times-of-contempt-205937.jpg?v=1694792691","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/times-of-contempt","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}